{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Single-display mode": {
      "comment": "Dock 栏显示位置子菜单 · 第一组标题（悬停底边切换 / 固定到某屏）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单屏模式"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Single-display mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multi-display mode": {
      "comment": "Dock 栏显示位置子菜单 · 第二组标题（③④）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "多屏模式"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multi-display mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "List every window": {
      "comment": "Dock 栏显示位置 ③：每块屏各一条、内容相同。动词用「列出」是为了避开系统 Dock 右键菜单的「显示所有窗口」（那是摊开窗口）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "列出全部窗口"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "List every window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "List only this display's windows": {
      "comment": "Dock 栏显示位置 ④：每块屏各一条、各屏只列本屏窗口",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只列出本屏的窗口"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "List only this display's windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\n\nIf simply turning the switch back on works, Tungsten Edge restarts itself and there is nothing else to do; going through the cleanup above means reopening it manually afterwards.\nAlso, windows the taskbar had moved out of its way may sit one taskbar height short — maximizing them once puts them back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n如果直接把开关打开就生效了，钨极会自己重启，不用管；走上面的清理步骤则需要退出后手动重开。\n另外，之前被 Dock 栏让开过的窗口可能会矮一条边——重新最大化一次就复原了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\nIf simply turning the switch back on works, Tungsten Edge restarts itself and there is nothing else to do; going through the cleanup above means reopening it manually afterwards.\nAlso, windows the taskbar had moved out of its way may sit one taskbar height short — maximizing them once puts them back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (default)": {
      "comment": "%@ 是应用名，「打开方式」子菜单里的默认应用",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（默认）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (default)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ (disconnected)": {
      "comment": "%@ 是屏幕名，「显示位置」Picker 里已断开的固定屏",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@（未连接）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (disconnected)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ failed (status code %d).": {
      "comment": "%@ 是可执行文件名，%d 是退出码",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 执行失败（状态码 %d）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ failed (status code %d)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ is already taken by another app. The previous shortcut stays active.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 改键失败弹窗",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已被其他应用占用，仍沿用原来的快捷键。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is already taken by another app. The previous shortcut stays active."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility Permission Required": {
      "comment": "状态栏菜单顶部的警告项，未授权辅助功能时显示",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能权限未开启"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility Permission Required"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility Permission Was Revoked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "辅助功能权限已失效"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility Permission Was Revoked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility permission required": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要辅助功能权限"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility permission required"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "激活"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Activated · %@ · %@": {
      "comment": "两个占位符依次是授权种类（原始用户 / 已购买）与邮箱。",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已激活 · %@ · %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activated · %@ · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Folder…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加文件夹…"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Folder…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Screenshot or Recording…": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈附件按钮",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加截图或录屏…"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Screenshot or Recording…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All attachments together must be 40 MB or smaller.": {
      "comment": "反馈附件被拒 · 合计超 40MB",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有附件加起来不能超过 40 MB。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All attachments together must be 40 MB or smaller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always": {
      "comment": "唤醒滑块左端的刻度标记，只有 34pt 宽——不是档位名（档位名是 Always Visible，显示在滑块中间）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常驻"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always Visible": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "常驻"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Visible"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An Attachment Can’t Be Read": {
      "comment": "反馈失败 · 附件在发送前被移走或删除",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有个附件读不出来"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An Attachment Can’t Be Read"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything you want to say — write it here.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈 · 「其他」的引导文字（输入框为空时叠显）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想说什么都可以写在这里。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anything you want to say — write it here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apply"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply Recommended Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apply Recommended Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用推荐设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply “%@” (the Dock will restart)": {
      "comment": "%@ 是滑块档位名，如 Always Visible / 0.5s",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用「%@」（Dock 会重启一下）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apply “%@” (the Dock will restart)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈附件选择面板的确认按钮",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attach"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attach a screenshot (PNG, JPEG, GIF, HEIC) or a screen recording (MOV, MP4).": {
      "comment": "反馈附件被拒 · 类型不在白名单",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请添加截图（PNG、JPEG、GIF、HEIC）或录屏（MOV、MP4）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attach a screenshot (PNG, JPEG, GIF, HEIC) or a screen recording (MOV, MP4)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attachment Limit Reached for Today": {
      "comment": "反馈失败 · 附件通道今日额度用尽",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附件通道今日已满"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attachment Limit Reached for Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attachments Are Too Large": {
      "comment": "反馈附件被拒 · 合计超 40MB",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附件总量太大"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Attachments Are Too Large"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回上一级"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bug Report": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈 · 类型单选",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问题反馈"
          }
        },
        "en": {
