    "Flips mouse-wheel scrolling system-wide, like Scroll Reverser. Trackpads and Magic Mouse are not affected. Tungsten Edge only inverts the direction values of scroll-wheel events; nothing is recorded or sent anywhere. If Scroll Reverser or Mos is also running, the two cancel out — keep only one.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反转滚轮说明（改写输入事件的披露文案）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把鼠标滚轮的滚动方向整体反过来（类似 Scroll Reverser）。触控板和妙控鼠标不受影响。钨极只把滚轮事件的方向值取反，不记录、不发送任何内容。若同时运行 Scroll Reverser 或 Mos，两者会互相抵消，请只保留一个。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flips mouse-wheel scrolling system-wide, like Scroll Reverser. Trackpads and Magic Mouse are not affected. Tungsten Edge only inverts the direction values of scroll-wheel events; nothing is recorded or sent anywhere. If Scroll Reverser or Mos is also running, the two cancel out — keep only one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
