        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use at least one of Command, Control or Option."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the scale effect when minimizing": {
      "comment": "owner 2026-08-28 定的推荐值，写 com.apple.dock mineffect = scale。中文用系统设置里的原词「缩放效果」。",
