        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video Is Too Large"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walks you through the first-launch recommendations again, including hiding the Dock.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 通用页「重新打开新手引导」的说明",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新过一遍首次启动时的引导，包括隐藏系统 Dock 那几条推荐设置。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walks you through the first-launch recommendations again, including hiding the Dock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Want the Dock back?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Want the Dock back?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "想让系统 Dock 回来？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warning": {
      "comment": "状态栏警告图标的无障碍描述",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should Tungsten Edge add or improve? Tell us how you'd use it.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈 · 功能建议的引导文字（输入框为空时叠显）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "希望钨极增加或改进什么？说说你的使用场景。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What should Tungsten Edge add or improve? Tell us how you'd use it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What went wrong? What did you do when it happened? Paste any details that might help.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈 · 问题反馈的引导文字（输入框为空时叠显）",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到了什么问题？怎么操作会出现？方便的话贴一下当时的情况。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What went wrong? What did you do when it happened? Paste any details that might help."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write something first.": {
      "comment": "设置窗口 · 反馈校验弹窗",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先写点内容。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write something first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can attach up to 3 files. Remove one first.": {
      "comment": "反馈附件被拒 · 超过 3 个",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多只能添加 3 个附件，请先移除一个。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can attach up to 3 files. Remove one first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your message or attachments were not accepted. Try shortening the message or using a different file, or email support@tungstenedge.app.": {
      "comment": "反馈失败 · 内容或附件被服务端拒绝",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内容或附件没被接受。试着精简内容或换一个附件，或发邮件到 support@tungstenedge.app。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your message or attachments were not accepted. Try shortening the message or using a different file, or email support@tungstenedge.app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re Already Subscribed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已经订阅过了"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’re Already Subscribed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re subscribed. When licensing arrives, it will be sent straight to your inbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已订阅。将来的授权会直接发送到你的邮箱。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’re subscribed. When licensing arrives, it will be sent straight to your inbox."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ve sent too many messages in a short time. Try again in a little while — your message and attachments are still here.": {
      "comment": "反馈失败 · 每小时限流",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "短时间内发送太多次了，请过一会儿再试。你写的内容和附件都还在。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You’ve sent too many messages in a short time. Try again in a little while — your message and attachments are still here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS ties Accessibility permission to one specific copy of an app. This copy is running from a temporary or read-only location, so turning the switch on will not take effect — and the permission record stays behind in System Settings after the disk image is ejected. Drag Tungsten Edge to your Applications folder and open it from there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 会把辅助功能授权绑定到具体的应用副本上。当前这份钨极跑在一个临时或只读的位置，就算你打开了开关也不会生效，而且卸载磁盘映像后那条授权记录还会留在系统里。请把 Tungsten Edge 拖到“应用程序”文件夹，再从那里重新打开。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS ties Accessibility permission to one specific copy of an app. This copy is running from a temporary or read-only location, so turning the switch on will not take effect — and the permission record stays behind in System Settings after the disk image is ejected. Drag Tungsten Edge to your Applications folder and open it from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "you@example.com": {
      "comment": "邮箱输入框的占位示例，两种语言相同",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "you@example.com"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "you@example.com"
          }
        }
      }
    }
